<%
  overdue_count = @overdue_top.to_a.count
  due_date_for = ->(definition) { @task_due_dates[definition.id] || definition.target_date }
  due_phrase = lambda do |date|
    next nil if date.blank?

    days = (date.to_date - Time.zone.today).to_i
    when_text =
      if days.negative?
        "#{days.abs} day#{'s' unless days.abs == 1} past"
      elsif days.zero?
        'today'
      elsif days == 1
        'tomorrow'
      else
        "in #{days} days"
      end
    "#{date.to_date.strftime('%a %-d %b')}, #{when_text}"
  end
  next_due = (@overdue_top.to_a + @soon_top.to_a + @ahead_top.to_a).first
  bar = ->(value) { ('#' * [(value.to_i * 24.0 / [@grade_task_total.to_i, 1].max).round, 0].max).ljust(24, '.') }
-%>
Hi <%= @student.first_name %>,

<%= @summary_stats[:unit].name %> - Weekly Summary
<%= "#{@summary_stats[:week_start].day.ordinalize} #{@summary_stats[:week_start].strftime("%B %Y")}" %> to <%= "#{@summary_stats[:week_end].day.ordinalize} #{@summary_stats[:week_end].strftime("%B %Y")}" %>
<% if @did_revert_to_pass -%>

FALLING BEHIND ON PASS TASKS
Your target grade has been reset to Pass while you catch up. Every Pass task has to be marked Complete to pass this unit, so work through them in order. Once you have caught up you can set your target grade back and return to the higher grade tasks you skipped.
<% end -%>
<% if @project.tutorial_enrolments.blank? -%>

NO TUTOR SET
You are not assigned a tutor. Set your tutorial so your work reaches someone:
<%= @doubtfire_host %>/projects/<%= @project.id %>/tutorials
<% end -%>
<% if overdue_count.positive? -%>

START HERE
<%= @overdue_top.first[:task_definition].abbreviation %> <%= @overdue_top.first[:task_definition].name %> is the one furthest past its target date, targeted <%= due_phrase.call(due_date_for.call(@overdue_top.first[:task_definition])) %>. Start there.
<% elsif @behind_target.to_i.positive? -%>

BEHIND THE TARGET SCHEDULE
<%= @behind_target %> task<%= "s" unless @behind_target == 1 %> <%= @behind_target == 1 ? 'is' : 'are' %> past <%= @behind_target == 1 ? 'its' : 'their' %> target date and not finished. None of them is on the list below, so open your dashboard to find them.
<% elsif next_due.present? -%>

NEXT TARGET DATE
<%= next_due[:task_definition].abbreviation %> <%= next_due[:task_definition].name %> is next, targeted <%= due_phrase.call(due_date_for.call(next_due[:task_definition])) %>. Nothing has slipped.
<% elsif @waiting_on_student.to_i.zero? && @project.portfolio_exists? -%>

ALL CAUGHT UP
Every task is done and your portfolio is prepared. Nothing is outstanding.
<% elsif @waiting_on_student.to_i.zero? -%>

ALMOST THERE
Every task is done. Prepare your portfolio to finish up.
<% else -%>

NOTHING TARGETED THIS WEEK
Nothing has slipped past its target date and nothing is targeted this week. <%= @waiting_on_student %> task<%= "s" unless @waiting_on_student == 1 %> <%= @waiting_on_student == 1 ? 'is' : 'are' %> still with you, so this is a good week to get ahead.
<% end -%>
<% [['PAST TARGET DATE', @overdue_top], ['TARGET DATE THIS WEEK', @soon_top], ['GET AHEAD', @ahead_top]].each do |group_label, group_tasks| -%>
<% next if group_tasks.blank? -%>

<%= group_label %>
<% group_tasks.each do |tt| -%>
* <%= tt[:task_definition].abbreviation %> - <%= tt[:task_definition].name %>
  Target <%= due_phrase.call(due_date_for.call(tt[:task_definition])) %> - <%= tt[:status].to_s.tr('_', ' ').capitalize %>
  <%= @doubtfire_host %>/projects/<%= @project.id %>/dashboard/<%= ERB::Util.url_encode(tt[:task_definition].abbreviation) %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% if @top_tasks_truncated -%>

These are the <%= NotificationsMailer::TOP_TASK_LIMIT %> most urgent. Your dashboard has the rest.
<% end -%>
<% if @needs_your_response.to_i.positive? -%>

FEEDBACK WAITING FOR YOU
<%= @needs_your_response %> task<%= "s" unless @needs_your_response == 1 %> <%= @needs_your_response == 1 ? 'has' : 'have' %> come back from your tutor and <%= @needs_your_response == 1 ? 'is' : 'are' %> waiting on you to resubmit, redo or talk it through.
<% end -%>

Open your unit in <%= @doubtfire_product_name %>:
<%= @doubtfire_host %>/projects/<%= @project.id %>/dashboard
<% if @grade_task_total.to_i.positive? -%>

YOUR <%= @project.target_grade_desc.to_s.upcase %> TARGET
<%= @tasks_complete %> of <%= @grade_task_total %> tasks complete.
<% if @behind_target.to_i.positive? -%>
<%= @behind_target %> of the <%= @targets_passed %> whose target date has passed <%= @behind_target == 1 ? 'is' : 'are' %> still open.
<% elsif @targets_passed.to_i.positive? -%>
All <%= @targets_passed %> whose target date has passed are done.
<% end -%>

PACE
Target date passed  <%= bar.call(@targets_passed) %> <%= @targets_passed %> of <%= @grade_task_total %>
Of those, finished  <%= bar.call(@on_target) %> <%= @on_target %> of <%= @grade_task_total %>
<% end -%>
<% if @status_summary.present? -%>

EVERY TASK, BY STATUS
<% @status_summary.each do |_status_key, label, count| -%>
<%= label.to_s.capitalize.ljust(32) %> <%= bar.call(count) %> <%= count %> of <%= @grade_task_total %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

WHOSE MOVE
* <%= @waiting_on_tutor %> with your tutor, waiting to be marked
* <%= @needs_your_response %> handed back for you to act on
* <%= @waiting_on_student %> still with you in total
<% if @sent_comments.zero? -%>
* 0 comments posted this week - asking your tutor a question is the fastest way to get unstuck
<% end -%>
<% if @weeks_left.present? && @weeks_left.positive? -%>

<%= @weeks_left %> week<%= "s" unless @weeks_left == 1 %> left in this unit.
<% end -%>
<% if @project.portfolio_exists? -%>

Your portfolio is prepared.<%= " You can keep changing it for another #{@portfolio_days_left} day#{'s' unless @portfolio_days_left == 1}." if @portfolio_days_left.present? && @portfolio_days_left >= 0 %>
<% elsif @portfolio_days_left.present? && @portfolio_days_left.between?(0, 42) -%>

PORTFOLIO
Your portfolio is not prepared yet and the deadline is <%= @portfolio_due.to_date.strftime('%a %-d %b') %>, <%= @portfolio_days_left.zero? ? 'today' : "in #{@portfolio_days_left} day#{'s' unless @portfolio_days_left == 1}" %>.
<% end -%>

Cheers,
The <%= @doubtfire_product_name %> Team on behalf of <%= @tutor.name %>

---

Visit <%= @unsubscribe_url%> to unsubscribe from these notifications.

Generated with <%= @doubtfire_product_name %>
